    "readme": "README.md",
    "extra": [],
    "summary": "ImaraDesk An open-source helpdesk and ticket management system built with Django and React. Features - **Ticket Management** - Create, assign, and track support tickets with customizable statuses and priorities - **Email-to-Ticket** - Automatically convert incoming emails into support tickets with IMAP/POP3 polling - **SLA Tracking** - Define service level agreements and monitor response/resolution times with auto-apply triggers - **Knowledge Base** - Build a self-service knowledge base with categories, approvals, and versioning"
  },
